<title>USA: Comdisco files shelf for $1.2 billion.</title>
<headline>Comdisco files shelf for $1.2 billion.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comdisco Inc filed Monday with the Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf registration to sell up to $1.2 billion in debt securities.  </p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes, including equipment purchases, repayment of short-term debt and redemption or repurchase of senior debt.</p>
<p>Comdisco, based in Rosemont, Ill., is a technology services company, providing solutions that help organizations reduce technology cost and risk.</p>
</text>
